        "title": "CompaniesHouseProfile",
        "description": "Companies House bulk-data profile of one registered company (contract J2.1).\n\nDerived on the utility box from the Free Company Data Product (monthly) and\nthe PSC snapshot (daily) by scripts/companies_house/p2_catalogue_features.py;\nthe dates of both snapshots travel with the row. `positive_classes` names the\ncensus classes the company falls into (sanctioned_company,\ncompulsory_liquidation, disqualification, psc_sanctioned_owner,\nattr:under_petition …); empty = none. Served only when the tenant's\n`companies_house_attribution` flag resolves true (contract J2.2): the block is\na licence-gated attribution layer, not part of the base verdict."
      },
