        "description": "A company-register identity of a VASP entity (Sprint 69 J phase 2, contract J2.1).\n\nToday only Companies House (GB): `registration_number` is the company number\n(8 digits, or 2 letters + 6 digits), `source` says how the entity was tied to\nit — `fca_register_uk` (the FCA cryptoasset register carries the number) or\n`companies_house_exact_name_match` (unambiguous exact / previous-name match,\nmedium evidence tier) — and `source_url` is the register page that proves it."
      },
